# Anthropic API key — powers the AI FAQ generator and the answer assistant.
#
# Server-side only. It is read exclusively by app/services/ai.server.js, which
# React Router strips from the client bundle because of the `.server` suffix,
# so this value never reaches a browser.
#
# Get one at https://platform.claude.com/settings/keys
# Leave it unset to run Faqly with the AI features hidden — nothing else breaks.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
